    {
      "id": "Sp2q9i7HptAErvfMjdanW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -227.41333862662665,
      "y": 1353.2703503730486,
      "width": 201.11993408203125,
      "height": 335.37169684351255,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1075974544,
      "version": 698,
      "versionNonce": 1349290384,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793182308681,
      "created": 1793181145689,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "对于解析时长，目前已经整\n理到的现状有以下不同维度\nsrc：\n1. 每个chunk解析需要额外\n启动FFmpeg进程，没有\nwarm up it all the time导\n致几秒的浪费\n2. 每个1min chunk实质信\n息量很少，但是model\nthinking内容很多，关键在\n于过往交给model的复杂职\n责冗余：understanding理\n应不需要canvas tool，而\n是直接输出schema\n3. ...（详见seekino proj)\n",
      "fontSize": 16.768584842175628,
      "baseFontSize": 18.768584842175628,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "XLbM-kmTUhnfobUw3WheC",
      "originalText": "对于解析时长，目前已经整理到的现状有以下不同维度src：\n1. 每个chunk解析需要额外启动FFmpeg进程，没有warm up it all the time导致几秒的浪费\n2. 每个1min chunk实质信息量很少，但是model thinking内容很多，关键在于过往交给model的复杂职责冗余：understanding理应不需要canvas tool，而是直接输出schema\n3. ...（详见seekino proj)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
